   LATE: Wald estimator = RF / FS via rdrobust fuzzy option.
   NOTE: credits_y1 and cgpa_y1 use sharp DGP; fuzzy LATE shown
         for pedagogical comparison. Prefer sharp estimates (§10.2.4).

